Subject: [PATCH 6.2 140/663] soc: ti: pm33xx: Fix refcount leak in am33xx_pm_probe
Date: Mon,  8 May 2023 11:39:26 +0200
Message-Id: <20230508094433.066170231@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.40.1
